格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Memory plugin (dsh-tool-project-memory): shared project organizational memory across presets — recall, remember, memory_status","id":"gh:1338196618","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"open-preset-harness","slug":"warrenop/open-preset-harness","topics":["ai-agents","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","memory"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Memory plugin (dsh-tool-project-memory): shared project organizational memory across presets — r"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ecall, remember, memory_status"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# open-preset-harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Project memory for multi-role AI agents — one knowledge base, every preset reads.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **DSH Profile Bundle:** `dsh-tool-project-memory` · Category: **Memory** · Install · DSH1024 check"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"DSH Profile Bundle:** `dsh-tool-project-memory` · Category: **Memory** · Install · DSH1024 checklist"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Agents forget between sessions. Teams don't.\n> **open-preset-harness** adds a **project-scoped org"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"anizational memory layer** on top of DeepSeek Harness: any role (preset) can contribute experience; "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"any role can recall it when needed."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness separates **preset** (who the agent is — tools, persona, prompts) from **session lo"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"g** (what happened in one conversation). That split is right for engineering — but **team knowledge "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"lives at the project level**, not inside a single preset or session."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Without shared memory:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- A security review preset rediscovers the same auth pitfalls every sprint\n- A new contributor prese"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"t repeats questions answered three months ago\n- Product decisions vanish when the PM's session ends\n"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"- Token spend grows because every role rebuilds context from scratch"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**open-preset-harness** makes project experience **compound over time** — like a team wiki that agen"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ts actually use, wired into the harness session log."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## What it is (and is not)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| **Is** | Open-source **project organizational memory** for Harness presets |\n| **Is** | Domain-org"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"anized, recall-on-demand, auditable contributions |\n| **Is not** | A replacement for DeepSeek Harnes"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"s (we extend it) |\n| **Is not** | Per-preset silos or a generic vector DB demo |\n| **Is not** | Clai"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ming to invent \"AI memory\" — we integrate it correctly for **multi-role teams** |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Relationship to DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Upstream:** DeepSeek Harness — plugin-based agent harness on Cordis\n- **Our approach:** Prefer *"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"*plugins + conventions** over a hard fork; track upstream releases\n- **License:** MIT — we preserve "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"upstream copyright in NOTICE\n- **Naming:** This is an **independent community project**, not an offi"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"cial DeepSeek product"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"We upstream-friendly fixes when possible; project-memory features live here until (if ever) they gra"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"endly fixes when possible; project-memory features live here until (if ever) they graduate upstream."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"See docs/architecture.md and docs/phase-0-memory-api.md."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Core concepts"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"1. **Preset** — role/capability shell (unchanged Harness semantics)\n2. **Session log** — full histor"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"y of one conversation (unchanged)\n3. **Project memory** — **stable, distilled, searchable** facts th"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"on (unchanged)\n3. **Project memory** — **stable, distilled, searchable** facts the whole team reuses"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Design rules**"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **One memory pool per project** — all presets read (governance controls write)\n- **Organize by dom"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ain/topic**, not by preset id (e.g. `security`, `api`, `onboarding`)\n- **Index + recall on demand** "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"— don't dump the whole library every turn\n- **Model-visible ⟺ logged** — Harness invariant; memory e"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"nters via inject/tools/session events"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Default layout:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Scenarios"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Scenario | Who writes | Who reads | Value |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| **Cross-functional delivery** | Any function | Any other preset | Decisions don't die in someone e"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"lse's session |\n| **Engineering ↔ QA** | Dev preset after API change | QA preset before test plan | "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"Fewer alignment loops |\n| **Product ↔ Engineering** | PM preset after scope call | Eng preset during"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" implementation | \"Why we chose B\" stays attached |\n| **Security / compliance** | Review preset afte"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"r audit | All presets | Constraints propagate |\n| **Onboarding** | Senior presets over time | New hi"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"re's preset day one | Context without senior interrupt |\n| **Open-source maintainers** | Triage pres"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"et | Release preset | Known issues and release norms |\n| **Agency / client work** | Account preset |"},{"id":"p28s8","text":" Delivery preset | Client preferences travel with the repo |\n| **Research → writing** | Literature p"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"reset | Drafting preset | Findings become citable facts |\n| **SRE / incidents** | Postmortem preset "},{"id":"p28s10","text":"| Debug preset | Incident learnings reduce repeats |\n| **Design systems** | Design preset | Frontend"},{"id":"p28s11","text":" preset | Tokens and exceptions stay aligned |\n| **Localization** | Translator preset | Dev preset |"},{"id":"p28s12","text":" Terminology stays consistent |\n| **Data / ML pipelines** | EDA preset | Modeling preset | Data quir"},{"id":"p28s13","text":" stays consistent |\n| **Data / ML pipelines** | EDA preset | Modeling preset | Data quirks persist |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"More in docs/scenarios.md."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Status"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"**v1.0.0** — Full roadmap shipped (Phase 0–3, Distill 1–3, LLM assist); dual-preset demo deferred (#"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"1.0.0** — Full roadmap shipped (Phase 0–3, Distill 1–3, LLM assist); dual-preset demo deferred (#3)."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Milestone | Status |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Memory API spec | ✅ phase-0-memory-api.md |\n| `.dsh/memory/` on-disk convention | ✅ |\n| `dsh-tool-"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"project-memory` bundle | ✅ packages/tool-project-memory |\n| Supersede governance (Phase 1) | ✅ phase"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"-1-supersede.md · #4 |\n| Session distill hook (Phase 1) | ✅ phase-1-distill.md · #5 #6 |\n| Recall ra"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"nking (Phase 2) | ✅ phase-2-recall.md · #7 #9 |\n| Write governance (Phase 3) | ✅ phase-3-governance."},{"id":"p33s5","text":"md · #8 #10 |\n| Distill + LLM assist | ✅ phase-1-distill.md · #11 |\n| Config reference | ✅ config-re"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"ference.md |\n| Dual-preset demo | 📝 deferred · #3 · walkthrough |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Capability-oriented, **demand-driven** from Issues and scenario feedback — no fixed dates."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Shipped (v1.0.0)"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Memory LLM assist: `distillAutoLlm`, `vectorEmbedModel: llm-keywords-v1` via Harness `ctx.llm`\n- C